DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10724::$$$message_0083_0000_0000$$$::On my way to the classroom, I pass by an awfully noisy group.::
10725::$$$message_0083_0001_0000$$$::"Hey, that girl was beautiful."[lr]::
10726::$$$message_0083_0001_0001$$$::"But, what is a foreigner doing here?"[lr]::
10727::$$$message_0083_0001_0002$$$::"Well, rather than a foreigner, wasn't it kinda weird? Well, there wasn't anything weird about [font italic=true]her[font italic=false]."[lr]::
10728::$$$message_0083_0001_0003$$$::"Don't sweat the small stuff. If she's beautiful, that's all that matters."[lr]::
10729::$$$message_0083_0001_0004$$$::"...I wonder if I was seeing things... I feel like her ears were long..."::
10730::$$$message_0083_0002_0000$$$::I pause.[lr]::
10731::$$$message_0083_0002_0001$$$::I can think of a few candidates when people mention beautiful foreigners with features like that. Why would one be here?::
10732::$$$message_0083_0003_0000$$$::I wanted to ask more about it, but that group had already disappeared towards the end of the hallway.[lr]::
10733::$$$message_0083_0003_0001$$$::When I glance to my side, I find that Issei has also stopped.::
10734::$$$message_0083_0004_0000$$$::"What happened, Issei?"[lr]::
10735::$$$message_0083_0004_0001$$$::"Well, I was a bit curious about what that group was talking about just now."[lr]::
10736::$$$message_0083_0004_0002$$$::"Kinda a rare deal for you to stick your nose into this sort of thing."::
10737::$$$message_0083_0005_0000$$$::"Well, it's just that what they were talking about rang a bell a bit.[lr]::
10738::$$$message_0083_0005_0001$$$::However, there is no need for me to worry about it."[lr]::
10739::$$$message_0083_0005_0002$$$::He seems to convince himself and walks off.::
10740::$$$message_0083_0006_0000$$$::I could've followed after him, but I couldn't help my curiosity.[lr]::
10741::$$$message_0083_0006_0001$$$::"...I guess I should ask."[lr]::
10742::$$$message_0083_0006_0002$$$::"Boss, I've already looked into it."::
10743::$$$message_0083_0007_0000$$$::"W[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]oah!"[lr]::
10744::$$$message_0083_0007_0001$$$::Someone suddenly calls to me from the side.[lr]::
10745::$$$message_0083_0007_0002$$$::Gotou, one of my classmates, makes an appearance. He's flipping through a student planner.[lr]::
10746::$$$message_0083_0007_0003$$$::...Seems he was watching some kind of detective show yesterday.::
10747::$$$message_0083_0008_0000$$$::"The victim's characteristics are foreign and beautiful. According to the testimony of witnesses, she has a good physique, and their impression of her includes a lot of purple."[lr]::
10748::$$$message_0083_0008_0001$$$::Nothing is actually written on his planner. He sure is speaking all fancy, though.::
10749::$$$message_0083_0009_0000$$$::"Purple...?"[lr]::
10750::$$$message_0083_0009_0001$$$::Is that about Rider?::
10751::$$$message_0083_0010_0000$$$::"Gotou. Where can we see this victim?"[lr]::
10752::$$$message_0083_0010_0001$$$::"Umm, there is a witness testimony that the victim came from the entrance and to the first floor hallway."[lr]::
10753::$$$message_0083_0010_0002$$$::"Thanks. Please continue to discreetly investigate."::
10754::$$$message_0083_0011_0000$$$::I should look around the first floor hallway.[lr]::
10755::$$$message_0083_0011_0001$$$::Even if Rider moved, there should be people that saw where she went.[lr]::
10756::$$$message_0083_0011_0002$$$::"Oh, boss! You need to return soon in time for our meeting. The general manager will be mad if you're late."[lr]::
10757::$$$message_0083_0011_0003$$$::"Deceive Ms. Fujimura for me if you must. I'll go to class even if I'm late."[lr]::
10758::$$$message_0083_0011_0004$$$::"Roger!"[lr]::
10759::$$$message_0083_0011_0005$$$::I go down the stairs, noticing Gotou giving me a salute in the corner of my eye.::
10760::$$$message_0083_0012_0000$$$::And I find my goal almost immediately.[lr]::
10761::$$$message_0083_0012_0001$$$::To be honest, I even wanted to turn around and go back, but it leaves a bad aftertaste to ignore someone who needs help.[lr]::
10762::$$$message_0083_0012_0002$$$::Issei probably also realized it was about Caster.::
10763::$$$message_0083_0013_0000$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all time=300]Boy does she stand out. She's clearly not acting suspicious, but she totally stands out.[lr]::
10764::$$$message_0083_0013_0001$$$::She must not know exactly where she needs to go, as she's taking her time and checking each sign and room carefully.::
10765::$$$message_0083_0014_0000$$$::"Ugh, Caster."[lr]::
10766::$$$message_0083_0014_0001$$$::"Oh, well isn't it the boy from Saber's place?"[lr]::
10767::$$$message_0083_0014_0002$$$::Caster is acting like it's natural, but I'm feeling uneasy.[lr]::
10768::$$$message_0083_0014_0003$$$::...I hear unsettling voices around me saying things like, "Who is that?" "That's the third year, Emiya." "Him again!?" "Why does the universe side with him, huh!?" "Hmm, wanna off him here?"::
10769::$$$message_0083_0015_0000$$$::"...What are you doing here? Also why are you dressed like that? What happened to, you know, the clothes you wear when walking around Shinto?"[lr]::
10770::$$$message_0083_0015_0001$$$::I ask her in a hushed voice.[lr]::
10771::$$$message_0083_0015_0002$$$::"You don't have to worry about that, boy. I have used magecraft to deceive the senses of those here. More importantly..."[lr]::
10772::$$$message_0083_0015_0003$$$::"What?"::
10773::$$$message_0083_0016_0000$$$::"Where is the faculty room?"[lr]::
10774::$$$message_0083_0016_0001$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
10775::$$$message_0083_0016_0002$$$::"W-what is that foolish look on your face?"[lr]::
10776::$$$message_0083_0016_0003$$$::"Well... Didn't it say on the information board at the entrance?"[lr]::
10777::$$$message_0083_0016_0004$$$::"Oh?"[lr]::
10778::$$$message_0083_0016_0005$$$::...Did she miss it?::
10779::$$$message_0083_0017_0000$$$::"...You're surprisingly naïve when it comes to things like this.[lr]::
10780::$$$message_0083_0017_0001$$$::First of all, you've been here before, right? Why do you want to know the location of the faculty room[line len=2]"::
10781::$$$message_0083_0018_0000$$$::"There are certain things that cannot be avoided. I don't keep track of every single little detail. Far too much work."[lr]::
10782::$$$message_0083_0018_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
10783::$$$message_0083_0018_0002$$$::Caster quietly says something a little interesting.[lr]::
10784::$$$message_0083_0018_0003$$$::I think I just saw a little into her true nature, here.::
10785::$$$message_0083_0019_0000$$$::"What are you doing, Emiya?[lr]::
10786::$$$message_0083_0019_0001$$$::The bell rang. Return to your classroom."[lr]::
10787::$$$message_0083_0019_0002$$$::"Lord Souichirou."[lr]::
10788::$$$message_0083_0019_0003$$$::Mr. Kuzuki silently sneaks up on us. Either class was about to begin for the first years, or he heard the commotion.::
10789::$$$message_0083_0020_0000$$$::"I have come to deliver your lunch, Lord Souichirou!"[lr]::
10790::$$$message_0083_0020_0001$$$::"I see. That is a relief."::
10791::$$$message_0083_0021_0000$$$::"It was hectic this morning... [l][say storage=sch0144_cas_0081 name=キャスター]I apologize for not noticing that you had forgotten."[lr]::
10792::$$$message_0083_0021_0001$$$::"No, the fault is mine."[lr]::
10793::$$$message_0083_0021_0002$$$::Mr. Kuzuki accepts the lunch wrapped in a fancy handkerchief with both hands. The two stare at each other, sandwiching the lunch.::
10794::$$$message_0083_0022_0000$$$::Caster's passionate gaze is directed towards Mr. Kuzuki. Mr. Kuzuki's gaze is directed towards his lunch. Caster, who looks down, nervously twiddles her thumbs before her.::
10795::$$$message_0083_0023_0000$$$::"I thought it may be a bother, but what had been prepared will go to waste... I also didn't want you to have to go buy food by yourself and be embarrassed..."[lr]::
10796::$$$message_0083_0023_0001$$$::"I see."[lr]::
10797::$$$message_0083_0023_0002$$$::I saw him happily eating bread stuffed with fried noodles the other day though.[lr]::
10798::$$$message_0083_0023_0003$$$::My guess is that the lunch made by his beloved is not the same thing to the both of them.::
10799::$$$message_0083_0024_0000$$$::"Today's side dish is grilled lotus root slices."[lr]::
10800::$$$message_0083_0024_0001$$$::"...Hm."[lr]::
10801::$$$message_0083_0024_0002$$$::Oh, the side dish that was on sale at Toyoetsu.::
10802::$$$message_0083_0025_0000$$$::"And cherry tomatoes pickled in honey lemon vinegar, too."[lr]::
10803::$$$message_0083_0025_0001$$$::"...Mm."[lr]::
10804::$$$message_0083_0025_0002$$$::Yeah, that too.::
10805::$$$message_0083_0026_0000$$$::"When I accidentally bought too much before, you still cleaned your plate, so I thought you liked it in particular..."[lr]::
10806::$$$message_0083_0026_0001$$$::"Yes."[lr]::
10807::$$$message_0083_0026_0002$$$::So do you or don't you like it? I can't tell anymore.::
10808::$$$message_0083_0027_0000$$$::Though I am surprised that this witch of a wife was able to get all that stuff.[lr]::
10809::$$$message_0083_0027_0001$$$::The side dish section in Toyoetsu is always a primary target for housewives. It's always sold out first thing in the afternoon. Was she lining up early or something?::
10810::$$$message_0083_0028_0000$$$::"By the way, Lord Souichirou. Do you have some time to talk now?"[lr]::
10811::$$$message_0083_0028_0001$$$::Mr. Kuzuki nods.[lr]::
10812::$$$message_0083_0028_0002$$$::I see, so he didn't have class, he just happened to pass by.[lr]::
10813::$$$message_0083_0028_0003$$$::"Um, actually..."::
10814::$$$message_0083_0029_0000$$$::Caster's glare pierces me before I even realize it.[lr]::
10815::$$$message_0083_0029_0001$$$::"...What, boy? If you're done with your business, move on."[lr]::
10816::$$$message_0083_0029_0002$$$::"Well, I have class."::
10817::$$$message_0083_0030_0000$$$::"Then be off with you. No need to stand around mooing about it like a cow."[lr]::
10818::$$$message_0083_0030_0001$$$::"Fine."[lr]::
10819::$$$message_0083_0030_0002$$$::Yeah, fair. I'm the one who stopped her.::
10820::$$$message_0083_0031_0000$$$::"Go on, shoo."[lr]::
10821::$$$message_0083_0031_0001$$$::Caster aside, I should go back before Mr. Kuzuki glares at me.::
10822::$$$message_0083_0032_0000$$$::"Lord Souichirou...[lr]::
10823::$$$message_0083_0032_0001$$$::Since I am visiting your workplace like this, I figured I should greet your colleagues... [l][say storage=sch0144_cas_0182 name=キャスター]Um, where is the faculty room..."[lr]::
10824::$$$message_0083_0032_0002$$$::"I will show you around."[lr]::
10825::$$$message_0083_0032_0003$$$::Mr. Kuzuki turns back.::
10826::$$$message_0083_0033_0000$$$::...Oh. [l][say storage=sch0144_cas_0191 name=キャスター]B-but, silly me so distracted with lunch that I didn't bring a single refreshment[line len=2][lr]::
10827::$$$message_0083_0033_0001$$$::L-let me do so next time!"[lr]::
10828::$$$message_0083_0033_0002$$$::"It is not a problem. There is no need to worry about it."[lr]::
10829::$$$message_0083_0033_0003$$$::"O-okay. [l][say storage=sch0144_cas_0201 name=キャスター]T-then, if you insist."::
10830::$$$message_0083_0034_0000$$$::Caster follows behind Mr. Kuzuki like a lovestruck girl, blushing all the while.[lr]::
10831::$$$message_0083_0034_0001$$$::She fixes her hair as she follows as well. I'm struck by how badly she wants to make a good impression for the sake of her husband.[lr]::
10832::$$$message_0083_0034_0002$$$::To think that Caster is finally making her faculty room debut... Mm, how moving.::
10833::$$$message_0083_0035_0000$$$::"It's enough of a treat having a topic like a beautiful wife reveal."[lr]::
10834::$$$message_0083_0035_0001$$$::"Right. It'll be the talk of the town for the week ahead... I mean..."[wvs][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4][lr]::
10835::$$$message_0083_0035_0002$$$::I try to turn around, but my head is fixed firmly in place.[lr]::
10836::$$$message_0083_0035_0003$$$::Tiger claws dig into my skull without mercy.::
10837::$$$message_0083_0036_0000$$$::"You know, young man...[lr]::
10838::$$$message_0083_0036_0001$$$::As a teacher, I cannot abide by you skipping class. Your life and future are far, far more important than some rumor about a woman."[lr]::
10839::$$$message_0083_0036_0002$$$::Goosebumps rise across my body as her menacing words make their attack.::
10840::$$$message_0083_0037_0000$$$::"No...[wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]this is... [wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]Only, ah... [wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]Your grip... [wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]M-my skull cracked... [wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]Someone help... [wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]P-police...[shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]"[lr]::
10841::$$$message_0083_0037_0001$$$::"Hm? Hmm? Your head hurts?"::
10842::$$$message_0083_0038_0000$$$::"I-I have a question, general manager!"[lr]::
10843::$$$message_0083_0038_0001$$$::"[shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-4]What?"::
10844::$$$message_0083_0039_0000$$$::"W-what about Gotou? H-he was supposed to cover for me!"[lr]::
10845::$$$message_0083_0039_0001$$$::"Fool, he died."[lr]::
10846::$$$message_0083_0039_0002$$$::Gotou...![shock vmax=30 time=600 count=7]::
10847::$$$message_0083_0040_0000$$$::"Taiga Fujimura~ returns to her classroom~[humming]"[lr]::
10848::$$$message_0083_0040_0001$$$::...I'm taken away to the bloody slaughterhouse known as the classroom, wriggling like a suffocating bonito.::
910789::$$$message_9083_0020_0000$$$::"I have come to deliver your lunch, Lord Souichirou!"[r]::

